EXPLANATION:
I rewrote the memory graph 3D renderer using WebGL2 with instanced nodes and batched line segments to easily handle 50,000 nodes at interactive frame rates. I also updated the backend overview endpoint and frontend query limits to pull the full graph instead of truncating at 2,000 nodes.

